Tommy Lagerman is an eight-year-old human boy. He wears shorts and a graphic tee and carries a backpack with a water bottle hanging from the side. The investigators found him in a clearing deep in the [[Verdant Expanse]], his ankle caught in a branch.

He said he was from [[Geography/Calaria/Wrenford|Wrenford]] and had been dared by a friend named Jonathan to walk into the forest for an hour. He got lost and was attacked by a tree. He can see in the dark and is not afraid of it. He wears a faint rainbow-colored raiment of the [[Iridescent Host|Host]]. When [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Cedric Corot|Cedric Corot]] questioned him he did not seem to be lying, but he had travelled many days from any settlement and did not look as though he had made the trek. He said he had been walking only an hour, though he had been in the forest for days.

He mentioned the Ghost Festival, a Halian custom in which children go door to door and are given guns. He was told the [[Green Father|Green Man]] is not real. He took a liking to the investigators and to their drawings and beef jerky, and [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/People/Cedric Corot|Cedric]] made him a deputy.

His mother is [[People/Karen Lagerman|Karen Lagerman]]. After the investigators brought him out of the forest they returned him home.
